<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>How happy is our portion here!</l><l>God is love, God is love.</l><l>His promises our spirits cheer;</l><l>God is love, God is love.</l><l>He is our sun and shield by day,</l><l>Our help, our hope, our strength, and stay,</l><l>He will be with us all the way:</l><l>God is love! God is love!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>In glory we shall sing again,</l><l>God is love, God is love.</l><l>Yes, this shall be our lofty strain,</l><l>God is love, God is love.</l><l>While endless ages roll along,</l><l>In concert with the heav’nly throng,</l><l>This shall be still our sweetest song,</l><l>God is love! God is love!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
